    <text>
        <front>
            <head>Document description</head>
            <p>
                <list>
                    <item><hi rend="bold">Repository:</hi> Biblioteca Nacional de Portugal (BNP)</item>
                    <item><hi rend="bold">Shelfmark:</hi> Esp. E3, 11-4-D, fls. 88r–88v</item>
                    <item><hi rend="bold">Support and Material:</hi> Fragment of laid bluish paper with irregular right and upper margins.</item>
                    <item><hi rend="bold">Extent:</hi> 1 leaf</item>
                    <item><hi rend="bold">Dimensions:</hi> 103 × 125 mm</item>
                    <item><hi rend="bold">State of Preservation:</hi> Well preserved.</item>
                    <item><hi rend="bold">Layout (<hi rend="italics">mise en page</hi>):</hi> Fol. 88r: single column; six lines in black ink, three additional lines in pencil at the top of the page, and three further lines at the bottom written in blue ink and pencil. Fol. 88v: blank.</item>
                    <item><hi rend="bold">Hands:</hi> Fernando Pessoa's handwriting in black ink, graphite pencil, and blue ink.</item>
                    <item><hi rend="bold">Contents:</hi> Fol. 88r contains text related to <hi rend="italics">The Duke of Parma</hi>; fol. 88v is blank.</item>
                </list>
            </p>
        </front>
        <body>
            <pb n="11-4-D-88r" facs="data/images/single/bn-acpc-e-e3-11-4-d-1-100_0180_88_t24-C-R0150.jpg"/>
            <div type="textColumn" facs="#_114D-88r-column">                
                <ab><del hand="hnd:FP-blackInkHandwriting" rend="strikethrough">King <seg xml:id="seg_114D-88-1" rend="hesitationMark">Laertes</seg>.</del></ab>
                <metamark function="doubt" target="#seg_114D-88-1"/>
                <lb/><metamark function="separation" rend="halfRule">___</metamark>
                <div type="addition" facs="#_114D-88r-graphiteAdd">
                    <sp who="psn:D1" cert="medium">
                    <ab>
                        <lb/><add hand="hnd:FP-graphitePencilHandwriting" place="above">How does a bitch cry when 
                            <lb/><unclear cert="low">bowed</unclear> <unclear cert="low">low</unclear>?</add>
                    </ab>
                </sp>
                    <sp>
                        <ab>
                            <lb/><add hand="hnd:FP-graphitePencilHandwriting" place="above">— I know <unclear cert="medium">not</unclear> my lord —
                                <lb/>Whatever cry it does.</add>
                        </ab>
                    </sp>
                </div>
                <div type="text" facs="#_114D-88r-blackText">
                    <sp who="psn:D1">
                        <speaker><add hand="hnd:FP-blueInkHandwriting" place="left"><persName ref="psn:D1">D</persName></add> —</speaker>
                        <ab>
                            <add hand="hnd:FP-blackInkHandwriting" place="above"><hi rend="circled">Bitch</hi></add>Faugh! Our mothers cried thus
                            <lb/>when we were conceived. <hi rend="boxed">But</hi>
                            <lb/>what would respect be if these
                            <lb/>things were thought on?
                        </ab>
                    </sp>
                </div>
                <div type="addition" facs="#_114D-88r-blueAdd">
                    <sp>
                        <ab><add hand="hnd:FP-blueInkHandwriting" place="inline">— This is naked language, my lord.</add></ab>
                    </sp>
                </div>
                <div type="addition" facs="#_114D-88r-graphiteAdd2">
                    <sp who="psn:D1" cert="medium">
                        <ab>
                            <add hand="hnd:FP-graphitePencilHandwriting" place="inline">— Ay so are we by nature. And
                            <lb/>have many known it?</add>
                        </ab>
                    </sp>
                </div>
            </div>
            <pb n="11-4-D-88v" facs="data/images/single/bn-acpc-e-e3-11-4-d-1-100_0181_88v_t24-C-R0150.jpg"/>
        </body>
    </text>
